{
  "version": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "Name-shortening rules for spec §7. Shipped inside the app bundle, but a copy placed at",
    "name-rules.json in the App Group container (next to config.json) overrides this one",
    "entirely, so the table can be extended without a rebuild.",
    "Order matters only within each list: noise suffixes are stripped from the end of a name,",
    "repeatedly, until none match; phrases are applied longest-first automatically."
  ],

